{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇·影响与遗产","stage":"DONE","category":"leonardo-da-vinci","categoryLabel":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/35_leonardo-da-vinci/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"列奥纳多-达-芬奇-影响与遗产\">列奥纳多·达·芬奇·影响与遗产</h1><p>本 hub 回答一个问题：达·芬奇去世（1519 年）之后，他<strong>作为后世遗产</strong>意味着什么？我们不复述他的生平或作品，而是追踪三条独立的「身后命运」——他如何被塑造成「文艺复兴人」的符号、他的艺术与科学如何（或为何未能）影响后世、以及他如何在当代被偶像化与商品化。本 hub 的一贯立场是：把「不朽」「天才」「永恒」这类赞颂，<strong>还原为可考证的历史与传播机制</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>经历了</strong>什么</td>\n<td>本 hub 始于他去世之后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>做出了</strong>什么</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲这些贡献的「身后影响」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>怎么思考</strong></td>\n<td>本 hub 讲方法如何被后世评价／遗失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表成就</a></td>\n<td>单件作品<strong>本体</strong></td>\n<td>本 hub 讲作品的传播与符号化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>影响与遗产（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>他<strong>留下了</strong>什么、被怎样<strong>记住</strong></td>\n<td>聚焦身后命运与神话建构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>有何缺陷／谜团</strong></td>\n<td>本 hub 引用其争议但不展开</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"章节与推荐学习路径\">章节与推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[1 文艺复兴&lt;br/&gt;符号如何被建构] --&gt; B[2 科学先驱&lt;br/&gt;科学影响的真相]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 现代偶像&lt;br/&gt;当代的偶像化]\">flowchart LR\n    A[1 文艺复兴&lt;br/&gt;符号如何被建构] --&gt; B[2 科学先驱&lt;br/&gt;科学影响的真相]\n    B --&gt; C[3 现代偶像&lt;br/&gt;当代的偶像化]</pre><ol>\n<li><strong><a href=\"renaissance/\">文艺复兴</a></strong> — <a href=\"renaissance/the-renaissance-man\">文艺复兴人</a>（「全才」标签的概念史与神话建构）、<a href=\"renaissance/influence-on-art\">对艺术的影响</a>（晕涂法传到拉斐尔／柯雷乔的可追踪谱系）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"science-pioneer/\">科学先驱</a></strong> — <a href=\"science-pioneer/anticipating-modern-science\">预见近代科学</a>（瓣膜涡流等超前 450 年的具体发现）、<a href=\"science-pioneer/the-fusion-of-disciplines\">学科的融合</a>（手稿流散导致科学影响为零的悖论）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"enduring-icon/\">现代偶像</a></strong> — <a href=\"enduring-icon/a-universal-genius\">全能的天才</a>（手稿与画作的天价变现）、<a href=\"enduring-icon/cultural-immortality\">文化的不朽</a>（蒙娜丽莎的大众文化造神）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 与 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>，了解「影响什么」之后，本 hub 的「如何影响」才有依托。</p>\n<p><strong>读者</strong>：对达·芬奇生平已有基本了解、想理解其文化与学术遗产如何被建构的读者。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"renaissance","title":"文艺复兴的化身","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/renaissance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-renaissance-man","title":"文艺复兴人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/renaissance/the-renaissance-man"},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-on-art","title":"对艺术的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/renaissance/influence-on-art"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"science-pioneer","title":"科学的先驱","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/science-pioneer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anticipating-modern-science","title":"预见近代科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/science-pioneer/anticipating-modern-science"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-fusion-of-disciplines","title":"学科的融合","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/science-pioneer/the-fusion-of-disciplines"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-icon","title":"永恒的偶像","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/enduring-icon","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-universal-genius","title":"全能的天才","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/enduring-icon/a-universal-genius"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cultural-immortality","title":"文化的不朽","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/enduring-icon/cultural-immortality"}]}]}